# Optional iPhone ARM64 debugger aid. Use only with the isolated development probe.
# Symbols may be unavailable on a given OS; check 'breakpoint list' for locations.
# No locations means no evidence. Do not substitute guessed addresses.
# C++ member ABI: x0=this, x1=size, x2=alignment. This traces requests, not usage.
breakpoint set --func-regex 'BumpMmapResourceAllocator.*allocateResource' --condition '$x1 >= 536870912'
breakpoint command add
register read x0 x1 x2
thread backtrace -c 14
continue
DONE
